WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.603 --> 00:00:05.925
1. In Manage hosting, open Backups.

2
00:00:05.925 --> 00:00:10.093
2. Find the backup from before the problem started.

3
00:00:10.093 --> 00:00:18.587
3. Click Restore and confirm. Files changed since then are replaced.

4
00:00:18.587 --> 00:00:23.927
4. You get an email when the restore finishes. Use Create backup first if you want a copy of today.
